The file src/wakehub/data/oui.tsv is a prefix-to-vendor extract of the public
IEEE Registration Authority OUI listing (https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui/oui.csv).
It is data published by the IEEE, not code, and it is included so MAC addresses
can be labeled without a network call. Organization names remain the property
of their registrants.

No device-control source code from MeshCommander, python-kasa, JetKVM, Shelly,
Synaccess, or CyberPower was copied into this repository. Those protocols are
implemented from their public interface descriptions.
